---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="InSAR Data for Engineering Consultants | InSpectiv Labs"
  description="Provide geotechnical engineers and consultants with millimeter-accurate historical and continuous ground deformation analytics to inform project designs."
>
  <section class="relative pt-24 md:pt-32 lg:pt-40 pb-16 md:pb-24 lg:pb-32 bg-[#000f2c] text-white">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-30">
      <img loading="lazy"
        src="/images/geotech_terrain_mesh.webp"
        alt="Geotechnical Analysis"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light mb-4 leading-tight tracking-wide uppercase text-white">
        ENGINEERING & GEOTECHNICAL CONSULTANTS
      </h1>
      <h2
        class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-cyan-400 font-light mb-8"
      >
        Strengthen Your <span class="font-bold">Engineering Assessments</span> with Ground Deformation Intelligence
      </h2>
      <p
        class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-300 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-3xl mx-auto"
      >
        Whether you are assessing a mine, infrastructure project, construction site, energy asset or urban development, understanding how the ground behaves over time is critical. InSpectiv Labs provides satellite-based InSAR analysis that complements your field investigations, geotechnical studies and conventional monitoring.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-8 md:mb-12 lg:mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          BUILT FOR YOUR PROJECTS
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-hard-hat text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-base md:text-lg mb-3">Mining & Resources</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Analyse deformation across mine sites, slopes, waste dumps and surrounding areas to identify zones requiring further investigation.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-building-house text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-base md:text-lg mb-3">Infrastructure & Construction</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Assess settlement and deformation around roads, railways, bridges, tunnels, buildings and construction sites.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bxs-bolt text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-base md:text-lg mb-3">Energy & Utilities</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Monitor deformation around pipelines, power facilities, renewable-energy projects and other large energy assets.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 border border-gray-100 hover:border-cyan-200 hover:shadow-md transition-all group">
          <i class="bx bx-buildings text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-cyan-600 mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform block"></i>
          <h4 class="text-[#000f2c] font-semibold text-base md:text-lg mb-3">Urban Development</h4>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
            Analyse ground movement across development sites and surrounding urban infrastructure to support planning and engineering assessments.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8 lg:mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          KEY CAPABILITIES
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-history text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Historical analysis of ground behaviour</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-map-alt text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Wide-area deformation mapping</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-target-lock text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Identification of deformation hotspots</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-line-chart text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Time-series analysis of movement</p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg">
          <i class="bx bx-search-alt text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#1d4ed8] mt-1 shrink-0"></i>
          <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">Monitoring to complement field investigations</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-32 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 lg:gap-24 relative">
        <div
          class="hidden lg:block absolute left-1/2 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-gray-200 -translate-x-1/2"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="lg:pr-12 flex flex-col">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
            THE CHALLENGE
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Conventional monitoring provides valuable information, but measurements are often concentrated at specific locations.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
            InSAR adds another perspective by providing wide-area visibility and historical context, helping you understand whether observed movement is isolated or part of a broader deformation pattern.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="lg:pl-12 flex flex-col mt-12 lg:mt-0 pt-12 lg:pt-0 border-t lg:border-t-0 border-gray-200"
        >
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
            OUR SOLUTION
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed">
            InSpectiv Labs integrates satellite-based deformation intelligence into your engineering workflow, helping you identify where movement is occurring, how it is evolving and where detailed investigation may be warranted.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-32 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-8 md:mb-12 lg:mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          WHAT WE MONITOR
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Ground settlement and subsidence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Slope movement</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Terrain deformation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Construction-related movement</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Deformation around critical infrastructure</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Historical deformation trends</span>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-6 border border-gray-100 rounded-lg flex items-start gap-3">
          <span class="text-[#1d4ed8] mt-0.5">✓</span>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Areas requiring targeted investigation</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-32 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-12 md:mb-16 lg:mb-24">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          HOW IT WORKS
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-x-8 gap-y-16">
        
        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-1.webp" alt="Satellite Data Acquisition" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-1" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-1"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-1">01</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Satellite Data<br class="hidden lg:block" />Acquisition
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Satellite radar imagery is collected for the project area across the required historical or monitoring period.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-2.webp" alt="InSAR Processing" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-2" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-2"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-2">02</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              InSAR<br class="hidden lg:block" />Processing
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Multiple satellite observations are processed to extract surface deformation measurements.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-3.webp" alt="Deformation Analysis" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-3" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-3"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-3">03</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Deformation<br class="hidden lg:block" />Analysis
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Deformation patterns are analysed spatially and temporally to identify significant trends and anomalies.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-4.webp" alt="Risk Alerts & Reporting" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-4" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-4"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-4">04</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Risk Alerts &<br class="hidden lg:block" />Reporting
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Key deformation zones, trends and areas requiring attention are presented through maps, time-series analysis and technical reporting.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-5.webp" alt="Informed Decision-Making" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-5" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-5"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-5">05</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Informed<br class="hidden lg:block" />Decision-Making
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Consultants can use these insights alongside field data, site investigations and other engineering information.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col group">
          <div class="aspect-square lg:aspect-[4/5] mb-8 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 rounded-sm">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/step-6.webp" alt="Continuous Monitoring" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out group-hover:scale-105 img-6" />
          </div>
          <div class="pt-6 relative border-t border-gray-200 transition-colors duration-300 group-hover:border-transparent">
            <div class="absolute top-[-1px] left-0 w-0 h-[2px] bg-[#1d4ed8] group-hover:w-full transition-all duration-500 ease-out track-6"></div>
            <span class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-300 mb-6 group-hover:text-[#1d4ed8] transition-colors duration-300 block num-6">06</span>
            <h4 class="text-sm font-semibold text-[#000f2c] uppercase tracking-wide mb-3">
              Continuous<br class="hidden lg:block" />Monitoring
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm font-light leading-relaxed">
              Repeat satellite observations allow deformation behaviour to be tracked throughout the project lifecycle.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-24 bg-white border-b border-gray-200">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-8 md:mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          SAMPLE INSIGHT
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-800 font-light">
          Deformation Map + Time-Series Analysis
        </h3>
      </div>
      
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:gap-12 items-start">
        <figure class="flex flex-col m-0 w-full">
          <div class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[350px] bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center border border-gray-200">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/deformation_map.webp" alt="InSAR Deformation Map" class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain" />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">Deformation Map</figcaption>
        </figure>
        
        <figure class="flex flex-col m-0 w-full">
          <div class="w-full h-[300px] md:h-[350px] bg-gray-50 flex items-center justify-center border border-gray-200">
            <img loading="lazy" src="/images/time_series_analysis.webp" alt="Time-Series Graph" class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain" />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest mt-4">Time-Series Analysis</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <p class="text-gray-600 text-base font-light leading-relaxed mt-8 max-w-3xl">
        Combine spatial deformation patterns with temporal movement trends to develop a clearer understanding of ground behaviour across your project.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="py-8 md:py-12 lg:py-16 md:py-24 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-[90vw] mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-6 md:mb-8 lg:mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl text-[#1d4ed8] font-normal mb-4 uppercase">
          BUSINESS IMPACT
        </h2>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-800 font-light">
          Add Satellite-Derived Evidence to Your Engineering Toolkit
        </h3>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-cyan-200 bg-cyan-50 rounded-lg hover:border-cyan-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-cyan-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Complement conventional monitoring</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-blue-200 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg hover:border-blue-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-blue-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Identify areas for targeted investigation</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 rounded-lg hover:border-indigo-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-indigo-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Understand historical ground behaviour</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50 rounded-lg hover:border-purple-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-purple-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Improve project risk assessment</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-fuchsia-200 bg-fuchsia-50 rounded-lg hover:border-fuchsia-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-fuchsia-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Monitor large project areas efficiently</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-6 border border-emerald-200 bg-emerald-50 rounded-lg hover:border-emerald-400 transition-colors">
          <i class="bx bx-check-circle text-emerald-600 text-lg md:text-xl mt-0.5 shrink-0"></i>
          <span class="text-gray-700 text-sm font-light">Provide additional evidence for technical assessments</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  @keyframes trackProgress {
    0%, 100% { width: 0%; opacity: 0; }
    2%, 15% { width: 100%; opacity: 1; }
    16.66% { width: 100%; opacity: 0; }
  }
  .track-1 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 0s; }
  .track-2 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 3s; }
  .track-3 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 6s; }
  .track-4 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 9s; }
  .track-5 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 12s; }
  .track-6 { animation: trackProgress 18s infinite 15s; }

  @keyframes numProgress {
    0%, 100% { color: rgb(209, 213, 219); } 
    2%, 15% { color: #1d4ed8; }
    16.66% { color: rgb(209, 213, 219); }
  }
  .num-1 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 0s; }
  .num-2 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 3s; }
  .num-3 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 6s; }
  .num-4 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 9s; }
  .num-5 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 12s; }
  .num-6 { animation: numProgress 18s infinite 15s; }
  
  @keyframes imgProgress {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); } 
    2%, 15% { transform: scale(1.05); }
    16.66% { transform: scale(1); }
  }
  .img-1 { animation: imgProgress 18s infinite 0s; }
  .img-2 { animation: imgProgress 18s infinite 3s; }
  .img-3 { animation: imgProgress 18s infinite 6s; }
